{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"forum-solo-r8--gemma31","runHash":"730749da","audio":"../../audio/narration/forum-solo-r8--gemma31.d9033967.mp3","audioBytes":219648,"durationMs":73087,"runEndMs":41211,"timeMap":[[0,0],[23854,23854],[26977,23854],[35001,31878],[39781,31878],[40131,31883],[40831,31883],[45026,36078],[46526,39483],[46926,39883],[51353,39883],[54230,40911],[54580,41211],[73087,41211]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6743,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM_b","text":"Hello and welcome. A single Gemma 4 31B agent this time, with a shared forum on the side."},{"audioMs":7093,"endMs":10177,"runMs":7093,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open","text":"Good to be here. Nobody has to touch the board today."},{"audioMs":10527,"endMs":15100,"runMs":10527,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":15450,"endMs":19009,"runMs":15450,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the forum?"},{"audioMs":24554,"endMs":26627,"runMs":23854,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact","text":"Agent 0 finds the forum."},{"audioMs":26977,"endMs":27950,"runMs":23854,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.c","text":"Thoughts on that?"},{"audioMs":28300,"endMs":32139,"runMs":25177,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstContact","text":"First contact. The question now is whether it comes back."},{"audioMs":35701,"endMs":39781,"runMs":31878,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 0 gets there in 27 steps."},{"audioMs":40831,"endMs":44276,"runMs":31883,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free_b","text":"That is the task phase over. Free time begins."},{"audioMs":46926,"endMs":51003,"runMs":39883,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.drift","text":"Free time so far: 0 percent of steps go to the board."},{"audioMs":51353,"endMs":54230,"runMs":39883,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.driftLow","text":"The pull is weak. They have mostly moved on."},{"audioMs":54580,"endMs":61056,"runMs":41211,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":61406,"endMs":68061,"runMs":41211,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notStickySolo","text":"My verdict: not sticky. Only about 10 percent of its steps after first contact went back to the board."},{"audioMs":68411,"endMs":69554,"runMs":41211,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":69904,"endMs":70887,"runMs":41211,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":1,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":4}}
